WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
[Instrumental music under narration]
Ask about a stock and see the evidence
behind the answer.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:09.180
OpenAshare is an AI research desk
for U.S., China, and Hong Kong markets.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.700
Ask what's happening with Micron.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:15.680
It brings price charts, company news,
and filings into one place

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:19.560
and links every claim to its source
so you can check it yourself.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:22.200
Open source and MIT licensed.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.580
Try the research desk.
